{"id":"n66265-1-7","stage":3,"title":"더하다 · 加","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66265-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 이 수학 문제 다 풀었어?","zh":"智秀，这些数学题都做完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"수학","meaning":"数学","explanation":"수학：数学","readings":[{"term":"수학","audio":"/audio/5c67e8578836de397afd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64718","senseId":"1","lemma":"수학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수학","audio":"/audio/5c67e8578836de397afd.mp3"}},{"text":"문제","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"풀었어?","meaning":"解开，解答","explanation":"풀다：解开，解答；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"풀다","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29761","senseId":"5","lemma":"풀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풀었어","audio":"/audio/d226cd0c9ff9ba3bd3bc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"5c67e8578836de39","term":"수학","zh":"数学","audio":"/audio/5c67e8578836de397afd.mp3","entryId":"64718","definition":"关于算数或空间测量等数和量的学问。","pronunciation":["수ː학"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"cada9014a11f228c","term":"풀다","zh":"解开，解答","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3","entryId":"29761","definition":"解决不懂、复杂的问题或找到其答案。","pronunciation":["풀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/51f87e5ac8eb42187691.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66265-1-7-2","ko":"응. 마지막으로 지금까지 나온 결과만 다 더하면 답이 나올 거야.","zh":"嗯。最后只要把到目前为止所有的结果加起来，就能得到答案了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"마지막으로","meaning":"最后，最终，末了","explanation":"마지막：最后，最终，末了；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28843","senseId":"1","lemma":"마지막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마지막으로","audio":"/audio/0606b3dd40050c6c83a0.mp3"}},{"text":"지금까지","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금까지","audio":"/audio/6552e756bd0ed13d0b77.mp3"}},{"text":"나온","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온","audio":"/audio/a357a1f232b9a828c908.mp3"}},{"text":"결과만","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결과만","audio":"/audio/12432175909364b1d1c0.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"더하면","meaning":"加，加上","explanation":"더하다：加，加上；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"더하다","audio":"/audio/fbcc89fc1f556bda8e03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66265","senseId":"1","lemma":"더하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더하면","audio":"/audio/40eb90cc2b0969b41424.mp3"}},{"text":"답이","meaning":"应答，解答","explanation":"답：应答，解答；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"답","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14003","senseId":"2","lemma":"답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"답이","audio":"/audio/d09f8b157c83a3fab723.mp3"}},{"text":"나올","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"16","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나올","audio":"/audio/ad9e4b1f57824c9990f8.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"8da62ef6312ba9ce","term":"마지막","zh":"最后，最终，末了","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3","entryId":"28843","definition":"在时间上或次序上的末尾。","pronunciation":["마지막"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"完成某种处理后产生结果。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"fbcc89fc1f556bda","term":"더하다","zh":"加，加上","audio":"/audio/fbcc89fc1f556bda8e03.mp3","entryId":"66265","definition":"添补使增加或变多。","pronunciation":["더하다"]},{"id":"9d0673c3b91f0428","term":"답","zh":"应答，解答","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3","entryId":"14003","definition":"对疑问或问题所要求的内容进行阐明；或指那种话。","pronunciation":["답"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/07440443bd2358068a9b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66265","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","s